          [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]scan[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]scan: add src/native/note_tasks.rs, a pure scanner that turns one note's[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Markdown into task records (line, indentation, status, description, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]block ID, section, child span, stale-safe ref digest), plus the small [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]markdown.rs ATX-heading extraction it depends on.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Sub-bullet capture in bob capture[/bold #D7AFFF]                             [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]write[dim] · [dim][/dim]after scan[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]write: teach bob capture the @<route>^<block-id> marker plus -t/--task [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and hidden --task-ref, render and insert the child bullet at the parent [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]task's own indentation, and report the new sub_bullet kind in human and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]JSON output.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob capture-tasks discovery command[/bold #D7AFFF]                           [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]list[dim] · [dim][/dim]after write[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]list: add the read-only bob capture-tasks subcommand that lists a note's[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]open tasks as colored human output and stable JSON for pickers, and wire[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]it into the runner, help surfaces, justfile smoke list, and README.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Hammerspoon task picker[/bold #D7AFFF]                                       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]ui[dim] · [dim][/dim]after list[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]ui: extend the chezmoi Hammerspoon capture panel with the @<route>^<id> [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]marker family, a status-annotated task chooser backed by bob [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]capture-tasks, sub-bullet success notifications, and busted coverage of [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the new request model.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli-2","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.6-sol","phase_bead_id":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli-2.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-7d32491b74ce00594eb76549bf364082","started_at":"2026-07-31T11:56:17.305852+00:00","state":"active"}],"schema_version":2,"structural_ancestors":["bbugyi200.athena.gh_bobs-org__bob-cli-2","bbugyi200.athena.gh_bobs-org__bob-cli-2.1","bbugyi200.athena.gh_bobs-org__bob-cli-2.2","bbugyi200.athena.gh_bobs-org__bob-cli-2.3","bbugyi200.athena.gh_bobs-org__bob-cli-2.4","bbugyi200.athena.gh_bobs-org__bob-cli-2.land"]}
